	"data": "Skill Tree: SPARQL & RDF Query Language\n\nGoal: Master SPARQL for querying RDF data in Solid Pods — from foundational triple model to federated queries against ThoughtBubbles data.\n\nContext: Full Solid Protocol adoption committed 2026-06-25. SPARQL is the query language for RDF data in Pods. Existing ThoughtBubbles JSON-LD data (using @context, @id, @type, LinkFrom/LinkTo) is already close to RDF — this tree bridges the gap.\n\nWhy this matters: Every piece of user data in Cyberspace lives in a…",
